{"src":"en","tgt":"ko","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":165000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"ko","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7948.737100999999,"text":"The Shenzhen zone however works somewhat like one country in this respect."},{"kind":"text","t":8962.761575999999,"text":"하지만 선전 지역은 이 점에서 어느 정도 단일 국가와 같이 기능합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":9088.360107999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9092.815416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":9097.986111999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9103.429364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":9103.889207,"samples":2396,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15103.657599999999,"text":"Resting on the top of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is closely"},{"kind":"text","t":16372.011389,"text":"메카 북쪽의 산 중 한 곳 꼭대기에 위치한 이 동굴은 매우 가까운 곳에 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":16478.297982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16479.620731,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":16480.964819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1090},{"kind":"audio","t":16482.720570999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16483.107485,"samples":10755,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":17735.880934,"text":"isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"text","t":18429.279376,"text":"세계의 다른 지역들과는 단절되어 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":18500.592506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18504.923586,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18507.458935,"samples":16941,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":26274.487059,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens never having to come close to a sharpener."},{"kind":"text","t":27579.852202,"text":"사람들은 이제 깎이는 도구에 가까이 갈 필요도 없이 컴퓨터 화면에 메시지를 씁니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":27688.945753,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27693.750035,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27699.125308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27704.430722999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27705.728501999998,"samples":11312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":37522.999764,"text":"Travelers bound for countries with heavy taxation can sometimes save a considerable amount of money, especially on products such as alcoholic beverages and tobacco."},{"kind":"text","t":39476.573282,"text":"높은 세금이 부과되는 국가로 여행하는 사람들은 특히 주류나 담배와 같은 제품의 경우 상당한 금액을 절약할 수 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":39647.674252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39652.406756,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":39657.882207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":39662.876807,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39668.127472,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39673.454406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":39678.595683,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":39678.894968,"samples":4123,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":45773.680846,"text":"Plants make their food from the sun by photosynthesis. They also provide shade."},{"kind":"text","t":46891.665033,"text":"식물들은 광합성을 통해 태양으로부터 영양분을 얻습니다. 그들은 그늘도 제공합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":47006.599469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47011.534539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47016.572168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47017.559822,"samples":8972,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"audio","t":47023.511136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47026.535527,"samples":20173,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"input","t":58050.959637,"text":"The hospital has followed protocol for infection control, including separating the patient from others to prevent possible infection of others."},{"kind":"text","t":59776.681641,"text":"병원은 다른 환자들에게 감염이 전파되는 것을 막기 위해 환자를 분리하는 등 감염 관리 절차를 준수하고 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":59941.772928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59946.804796,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59952.098671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59957.276278,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59962.511783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59967.792708,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59969.644068,"samples":14600,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":68162.93941600001,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical, but the program was written to simulate observations made of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"text","t":70208.900584,"text":"수행된 작업은 대부분 이론적인 성격이었지만, 이 프로그램은 인디언자리 은하에 대한 관측 결과를 시뮬레이션하기 위해 만들어졌습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":70397.47028200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70402.284104,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70407.50369000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":70412.611308,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70417.88978200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":70423.11530800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70428.272435,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70431.24949700001,"samples":25021,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":78291.367079,"text":"Barcelona's official languages are Catalan and Spanish. About half prefer to speak Catalan, a vast majority understands it, and virtually everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"text","t":80533.46085300001,"text":"바르셀로나의 공식 언어는 카탈루냐어와 스페인어입니다. 약 절반은 카탈루냐어를 사용하는 것을 선호하며, 압도적 다수는 이 언어를 이해하고, 거의 모든 사람이 스페인어를 알고 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":80641.683667,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80646.58135800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80651.83682400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":80652.150519,"samples":1170,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":80726.93590200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80732.088149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80737.27089500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":80742.42571200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80747.695517,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80752.86325400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80755.15659700001,"samples":14879,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":83785.65029300001,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is enough and other several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"text","t":85227.55744500001,"text":"일부 지역에서는 물을 1분만 끓이면 충분하지만, 다른 지역에서는 몇 분 더 끓여야 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":85352.389861,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85357.42719,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85362.867232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85368.078878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85372.93803,"samples":30817,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":89844.53686000001,"text":"Plants look their best when in a natural environment, so resist the temptation to remove even just one stem."},{"kind":"text","t":91516.01512800001,"text":"식물들은 자연 환경에서 가장 아름답게 자라므로, 단 하나의 줄기라도 뽑고 싶은 유혹을 이겨내야 합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":91663.591738,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91668.460949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91673.77486300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91679.008239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91684.068847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91687.447463,"samples":20897,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":600},{"kind":"input","t":97258.346351,"text":"During the 1920s, the prevailing attitudes of most citizens and nations was that of pacifism and isolation."},{"kind":"text","t":98699.15184,"text":"1920년대에는 대부분의 시민과 국가들의 주류적인 태도가 평화주의와 고립주의였습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":98844.39680700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98849.38872700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98854.538174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98859.76428,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98865.01582500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":98865.30234000001,"samples":2507,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":103516.11006,"text":"Masa Serif was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except other Mosul"},{"kind":"text","t":104998.824223,"text":"마사 세리프는 당시 최고의 포식자였기에, 다른 모술들 외에는 아무것도 두려워하지 않았다."},{"kind":"audio","t":105135.09754500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105139.907248,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105145.572316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105150.743853,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":105154.882106,"samples":25244,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":113120.30132000001,"text":"Since the foundation of Asuncion in 1537, Paraguay has managed to keep a lot of its indigenous character and identity."},{"kind":"text","t":114849.84672100001,"text":"1537년 아순시온이 건설된 이래, 파라과이는 자국의 원주민적 특성과 정체성을 대부분 유지해왔습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":115035.49312700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115036.84151500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115038.22297300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115039.92685500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115041.47549000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115043.094584,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115043.77304300001,"samples":19616,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":119857.13580100001,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs, which then migrates to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"text","t":121068.273805,"text":"이 질병은 돼지에 의해 전파되며, 그 후 모기를 통해 인간에게 옮겨갑니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":121189.764005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121194.695286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121200.00326000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121204.51947700001,"samples":27362,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"input","t":129343.75331700001,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are enormous facilities in remote areas with favorable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"text","t":130727.068043,"text":"대부분의 현대 연구용 망원경들은 대기 조건이 우수한 외진 지역에 위치한 거대한 시설들입니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":130881.311785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130886.37163400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":130891.711228,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":130896.90014400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130902.343376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130903.515227,"samples":10030,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":135212.818206,"text":"People may not anticipate that patience and understanding are also necessary for travelers"},{"kind":"text","t":136366.441568,"text":"사람들은 여행자에게도 인내와 이해심이 필요하다는 것을 예상하지 못할 수 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":136494.02231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136498.97499000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136504.17890600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136509.587839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":136510.948777,"samples":12427,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":140529.133891,"text":"So it is likely that the notation was added simply as a label."},{"kind":"text","t":141453.278654,"text":"따라서 그 표기는 단순히 라벨로 추가된 것으로 보입니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":141553.871172,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141558.815092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141564.006558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":141565.225949,"samples":10086,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":147758.48224800001,"text":"But there are a lot of things about birds that still look like a dinosaur."},{"kind":"text","t":148737.064883,"text":"하지만 새들에게도 여전히 공룡과 닮은 점이 많이 있습니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":148837.49237300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148842.549212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148847.912275,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148849.299693,"samples":11758,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":154945.40199,"text":"They are almost all sandy beaches with safe swimming and most have shade provided by"},{"kind":"text","t":155959.711828,"text":"거의 모두 수영에 안전한 모래 해변이며, 대부분 그늘을 제공합니다."},{"kind":"audio","t":156052.850226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156057.655478,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":156063.11327,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156065.706658,"samples":16774,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":157893.630543,"text":"Pohican trees."},{"kind":"text","t":158303.02108900002,"text":"포히칸 나무들."},{"kind":"audio","t":158340.588483,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":158340.917098,"samples":2619,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":164330.595791,"text":"Duvall, who is married with two adult children, did not leave a big impression on Miller, to whom the story was related."},{"kind":"text","t":165827.04379300002,"text":"성인 자녀 두 명이 있는 기혼자인 듀발은 이 이야기를 전해준 밀러에게 큰 인상을 남기지 못했다."},{"kind":"audio","t":165972.32907900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165977.527326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165982.84376000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":165988.223153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":165993.633116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":165995.54177500002,"samples":14210,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":320},{"kind":"close","t":176005.348112,"code":1005}]}